    "intro_html":  "Al pastor is the taqueria classic where marinated pork meets charred pineapple on a spinning trompo. We keep the marinade and the pineapple and move it onto chicken thigh, which is cheaper, leaner and just as happy soaking up achiote, chipotle and citrus. Charred pineapple goes right in the wrap so every few bites turn sweet. Each burrito lands \u003cstrong\u003eunder 400 calories with 4 ounces of meat\u003c/strong\u003e and \u003cstrong\u003e{{protein}} grams of protein\u003c/strong\u003e, on a high fiber tortilla that holds near 5 grams of net carb. There is no al pastor in our catalog yet, so this one is new ground rather than a wrapped version of a bowl.",
